MDL313, F4: with quotes kept, outputdir="/work/dump" is the relative path
"/work/dump" (quotes included), whose first component, a directory named '"',
does not exist: mydumper cannot create the output directory and aborts at
startup ("Unable to create"), before connecting.
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.1-1
args: --defaults-file /work/mydumper.cnf --host mysql --user e2e --password e2e-password --database app
lint: MDL313
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: nonzero
expect stderr-contains: Unable to create `"/work/dump"'
expect connected: false
-- mydumper.cnf --
[mydumper]
outputdir="/work/dump"
